{"v":"v45","content":"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 33px;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 39px;\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 33px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 39px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">Groen Koringlande</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><u><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 0);\"><span style=\"\">Summary</span></span></u></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: Bitter;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 255, 0);\"><span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Hierdie lied is 'n nostalgiese en romantiese uitbeelding van twee mense </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">wat saam deur groen koringlande wandel. </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Dit fokus op temas van samesyn, die skoonheid van die natuur tydens</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">die skemeruur, en 'n geestelike of droomagtige reis na 'n \"paradys.\" </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Die herhaling van die koringlande dien as 'n simbool van 'n veilige, </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">rustige plek wat die liefdesverhouding lewenslank bewaar en beskerm. </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Daar is ook 'n verwysing na 'n hoër mag of figuur wat die wolke lei, </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">wat 'n gevoel van vrede en goddelike leiding aan die lirieke verleen.</div></span></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div></span></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></span></div></span></span></span></span><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 39px;\"></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><u>Lyrics</u></span></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 23px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Elke aand langs die groen koringlande</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Wag jy daar as die skaaduwees daal</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Hand aan hand deur die groen koringlande</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Sal ons saam in die skemer in dwaal</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">As die maan deur die wolke vir ons loer </div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">word ons saam na 'n paradys gevoer</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Drome droom ons in groen koringlande</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Wat ons lewens lank saam kan bewaak</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Elke aand langs die groen koringlande\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Wag jy daar as die skaaduwees daal\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Hand aan hand deur die groen koringlande\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Sal ons saam in die skemer in dwaal\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">As die maan deur die wolke vir ons loer \r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">word ons saam na 'n paradys gevoer\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Drome droom ons in groen koringlande\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Wat ons lewens lank saam kan bewaak</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Wat ons lewens lank saam kan bewaak</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Elke aand langs die groen koringlande\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Wag jy daar as die skaaduwees daal\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Hand aan hand deur die groen koringlande\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Sal ons saam in die skemer in dwaal\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">As die maan deur die wolke vir ons loer \r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">word ons saam na 'n paradys gevoer\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Drome droom ons in groen koringlande\r</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Wat ons lewens lank saam kan bewaak</div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Elke aand langs die groen koringlande\r</div><div 